AB  - Zac Broitman discusses how Business Analysts can improve project outcomes by embracing user stories. The article highlights the role of user stories in Agile development and how they facilitate clearer communication and better alignment between teams and stakeholders. Broitman provides insights on how analysts can leverage this tool to drive success and deliver value to customers.
